<title>SWEDEN: Saab AB 9-mo profit falls to 84 mln SKR.</title>
<headline>Saab AB 9-mo profit falls to 84 mln SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saab AB, excluding Saab Automobile AB, reports for the nine months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		     84 vs   223</p>
<p> Turnover				    5,653 vs 4,869</p>
<p> Operating costs			   5,281 vs 4,686</p>
<p> Depreciation				  442 vs   450</p>
<p> Operating loss			 LOSS 311 vs   268 LOSS</p>
<p> Net financial items			 395 vs   491</p>
<p> Tax						24 vs    72</p>
<p> Minorities			    CHARGE 10 vs     5 CHARGE</p>
<p> Net profit				     50 vs   146</p>
<p>NOTE -- Saab AB is the unit of Investor AB which includes Saab Military Aircraft, Saab Dynamics, Saab Training Systems, Saab Aircraft and Saab Combitech.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
